<title>UK: Commerbank sets warrants on mark/sterling.</title>
<headline>Commerbank sets warrants on mark/sterling.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commerzbank has issued 10 million American-style call warrants, in two equal tranches, on the mark/dollar exchange rate, lead manager Commerz Financial Products said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 19.DEC.96-10.SEP.97   PAYDATE	12.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFURT, DUSS	     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> RATIO	     1:100</p>
<p>* * * * * * * *</p>
<p> TYPE	    STRIKE	 ISSUE</p>
<p> CALL	    2.60 DEM     3.76 DEM</p>
<p> CALL	    2.65 DEM     2.52 DEM</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
